{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read(*)",
      "Grep(*)",
      "Glob(*)",
      "Write(.claude/**)",
      "Edit(.claude/**)",
      "Bash(npm test*)",
      "Bash(npx prettier*)",
      "Bash(npx eslint*)",
      "Bash(git diff*)",
      "Bash(git log*)",
      "Bash(git status*)",
      "Bash(git branch*)",
      "Bash(cat .claude/memory/*)",
      "Bash(ls *)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/session-start-restore.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/pre-compact-prepare.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "COMPACTION IMMINENTE — Le contexte va etre resume et les details perdus.\n\nAvant la compaction, sauvegarde les informations durables :\n\n1. **Etat du travail** -> `.claude/memory/daily/{DATE}.md` (append, format: `## Session [heure] — [resume]`)\n2. **Decisions prises** -> `.claude/memory/decisions.md` (append)\n3. **Erreurs et solutions** -> `.claude/memory/errors.md` (append)\n4. **Faits durables** -> `.claude/memory/MEMORY.md` (si changement)\n5. **Patterns detectes** -> `.claude/memory/patterns.md` (append)\n\nRegles : MEMORY.md < 200 lignes. Daily logs = append-only. Ne sauvegarde que l'utile. Cree le dossier `.claude/memory/daily/` s'il n'existe pas."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/post-write-validate.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write(*.ts)|Write(*.js)|Write(*.py)|Write(*.go)",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/post-write-suggest-tests.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/pre-tool-security-scan.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/stop-session-finalize.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
